---
/**
 * The home page's chrome: two hairlines down the viewport's left edge. The
 * accent line fills as the reader moves through the record; the rust line
 * stays inert -- the grammar the record-spine panel explains in words.
 * Purely decorative: aria-hidden, pointer-inert, and it never intercepts
 * scroll. It only animates with CSS scroll-driven animation, where the
 * browser ties the fill to reading progress; everywhere else it is static.
 */
---

<div class="home-rail" aria-hidden="true">
  <span class="home-rail__line home-rail__line--record"></span>
  <span class="home-rail__line home-rail__line--institution"></span>
</div>
